  "description": "LEVELS OF ASSISTANCE AND AUTONOMY Five power levels to manage assistance in the best way possible, ensuring exceptional performance to tackle any type of terrain. MOTOR Limitless power with OLI SPORT PLUS which develops a torque of 85 Nm. This version expresses all the possible power for those who do not want to set limits. The assistance amazes from the first pedal stroke and adapts perfectly to any route, thus allowing the user to concentrate on riding, offering unimaginable sensations. BATTERY CAMBRIDGE is equipped with an integrated 630 Wh battery for a range of up to 200 km.\n\nBE GREEN TECHNOLOGIES Intuitive and fully equipped, the CAMBRIDGE features a 27.5″ aluminum frame with a fully integrated battery. The OLI SPORT motor in the PLUS version has 85Nm of torque for powerful yet smooth and natural assistance. Paired with the 630 Wh battery, it ensures long-lasting enjoyment for up to 200 km. IDEAL FOR CAMBRIDGE is a high-performance pedal-assisted city bike, ideal for urban routes and light gravel paths. Its 27.5\" wheels make it particularly agile and easy to handle, perfect for moving through city traffic, tackling bike paths, or navigating mixed terrain with ease. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a commuter for your daily commute, reliable and easy to handle, with a high autonomy for long-lasting fun.",
